    LLM: "In Phase One, try to accumulate a small stack by giving away cards whenever possible. Cards that fit on opponents' stacks are your friends.\n\nPlan your Phase Two hand during Phase One. Keep track of which cards you've seen. The trump suit is unknown until the last talon cardâ€”plan for flexibility.\n\nIn Phase Two, sometimes picking up a low card is better than using a high card to beat. Save your high cards for when you really need them. Force opponents to pick up by playing cards they can't easily beat.",
